    "Horizontal axis: array size from %lld to %lld items. Vertical axis: predicted operations on a shared scale set at %lld items, without units. Across selectable sizes %lld to %lld, Detected (solid line) changes from %@ to %@; Fitted (Used by App, dashed line) changes from %@ to %@. The dotted line marks the maximum selectable size, %lld items." : {
